# NET-SCN-VERBS: the network runner's three verbs - a number off a log line (Число / Всегда), a role's exit code
# (Выход) and a bot's console (Консоль B stop | walk | drop | corrupt) - proven on the case they were missing for:
# WP-FAR-15's lowered budget (far15_budget, 8 bots at 20-40 m) and its refused start, a bot that stops and walks on,
# and one message kind dropped or corrupted on purpose (DesertNetProbe's FaultTransport, a decorator over the bot's
# transport). Played by scripts/Dev/net_scenario.py through play_scenario.py, as WP-FAR-15: DesertServer --role all
# on WP_Protocol with a 30 ms jitter on its send link, observer A = Editor (--shot-player-view, every frame recorded),
# bots B1..B8 = DesertNetProbe --bot walking a circle (--turn-deg-s 36), every client on a 75 ms / 2 % link.
# The budget is the server's command-line config layer (DesertServer --config Net.BudgetBytesPerSecond=2048, laid
# over Config/Engine.json and its platform layer; nothing in the tree is written) and is read back off the server's
# own "net settings" line, never copied from the scenario.
# Numbers that must agree: bad's exit code 7; budget1 == 2048; every "net rates" line <= 2048 B/s for A; deferred > 0
# in the last; longest wait <= 60 steps in every line; period 2 for B1 inside 50 m; |r0 - r1| <= 0.03 s; exactly
# three "malformed Input dropped"; no "malformed Snapshot"; "0 snap(s)" in every A line.
Мир Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
# A refused start: Bands of descending ToCm through --config. ValidateNetSettings judges them (the one rule of the Net
# section) and the server exits 7 before it opens its port; that port is free again for the real server.
Роль bad server --role all --source 0,0,0 --pawn assets:Prefabs/Pawn_Player.deprefab --spawn 0,-421,650 --spawn 0,-464,150 --spawn 300,-418,150 --spawn -300,-511,150 --steps 1000000 --config 'Net.Bands=[{"ToCm":40000,"EverySteps":2},{"ToCm":5000,"EverySteps":4},{"ToCm":0,"EverySteps":10}]'
Ждать bad 60 \[Server\] ValidateNetSettings: Net band 1 reaches 5000 cm, not past band 0 \(40000 cm\): ToCm must ascend
Выход bad 30 7
Нет bad \[Server\] listening on port
# The real server, budget lowered to 2048 B/s by the same layer.
Роль server server lag=75 jitter=30 loss=2 --role all --source 0,0,0 --pawn assets:Prefabs/Pawn_Player.deprefab --spawn 0,-421,650 --spawn 0,-464,150 --spawn 300,-418,150 --spawn -300,-511,150 --steps 1000000 --config Net.BudgetBytesPerSecond=2048
Ждать server 60 \[Server\] net settings: .* budget 2048 B/s, .* --config sets 1 key\(s\): Net\.BudgetBytesPerSecond
Запомнить budget server \[Server\] net settings: .* budget (\d+) B/s
Число server \[Server\] net settings: .* budget (\d+) B/s == 2048
Ждать server 60 \[Server\] listening on port
Роль A editor account=1 lag=75 loss=2 --play --shot-frames 100000 --shot-every 1 --shot-player-view --quality PostProcess.MotionBlurQuality=0
Ждать A 1800 \[Net\] in session
Ждать server 60 player \d+ account 1 \(
Запомнить a server player (\d+) account 1 \((-?\d+), (-?\d+), (-?\d+)\)
# Eight bots, each put as soon as it is in: along -Z from A (A's player view looks down -Z) and +-X, 20-40 m away,
# dropped from 5 m above A's height onto the ground; each walks its circle for the whole run.
Роль B1 bot account=2 lag=75 loss=2 --seconds 15000 --walk-cm 100000000 --turn-deg-s 36
Ждать server 60 player \d+ account 2 \(
Запомнить ba server player (\d+) account 2 \(
Консоль server teleport {ba1} {a2+600} {a3+500} {a4-1900}
Ждать server 30 player {ba1}: pawn \d+ teleported to
# B1's pawn net id: A's per-pawn lines and the server's dormant/awake lines carry it.
Запомнить bp server player {ba1}: pawn (\d+) teleported to
Роль B2 bot account=3 lag=75 loss=2 --seconds 15000 --walk-cm 100000000 --turn-deg-s 36
Ждать server 60 player \d+ account 3 \(
Запомнить bb server player (\d+) account 3 \(
Консоль server teleport {bb1} {a2-600} {a3+500} {a4-1900}
Ждать server 30 player {bb1}: pawn \d+ teleported to
Роль B3 bot account=4 lag=75 loss=2 --seconds 15000 --walk-cm 100000000 --turn-deg-s 36
Ждать server 60 player \d+ account 4 \(
Запомнить bc server player (\d+) account 4 \(
Консоль server teleport {bc1} {a2+1400} {a3+500} {a4-2400}
Ждать server 30 player {bc1}: pawn \d+ teleported to
Роль B4 bot account=5 lag=75 loss=2 --seconds 15000 --walk-cm 100000000 --turn-deg-s 36
Ждать server 60 player \d+ account 5 \(
Запомнить bd server player (\d+) account 5 \(
Консоль server teleport {bd1} {a2-1400} {a3+500} {a4-2400}
Ждать server 30 player {bd1}: pawn \d+ teleported to
Роль B5 bot account=6 lag=75 loss=2 --seconds 15000 --walk-cm 100000000 --turn-deg-s 36
Ждать server 60 player \d+ account 6 \(
Запомнить be server player (\d+) account 6 \(
Консоль server teleport {be1} {a2+0} {a3+500} {a4-2800}
Ждать server 30 player {be1}: pawn \d+ teleported to
Роль B6 bot account=7 lag=75 loss=2 --seconds 15000 --walk-cm 100000000 --turn-deg-s 36
Ждать server 60 player \d+ account 7 \(
Запомнить bf server player (\d+) account 7 \(
Консоль server teleport {bf1} {a2+1200} {a3+500} {a4-3600}
Ждать server 30 player {bf1}: pawn \d+ teleported to
Роль B7 bot account=8 lag=75 loss=2 --seconds 15000 --walk-cm 100000000 --turn-deg-s 36
Ждать server 60 player \d+ account 8 \(
Запомнить bg server player (\d+) account 8 \(
Консоль server teleport {bg1} {a2-1200} {a3+500} {a4-3600}
